    <task id="LOCAL-00147" summary="Rusty Skylines Alpha v1.6.0b Feb 17th 23:04&#10;&#10;[Major]&#10;Switched from clipper2 to clipper2-rust crate, a finished rewrite of Clipper 2 C++.&#10;It is not FFI and fully Rust native and feature complete and has a 100% parity with the C++ version, completely written in safe Rust only!&#10;&#10;&#10;[Minor]&#10;The starfield now actually moves around the earth! (Or the earth spins? Oh god, I am god)&#10;&#10;All cars now actually rotate correctly to the terrain.&#10;&#10;Added more robust data path handling after seeing my game crash because of it on my brothers Windows machine.&#10;&#10;&#10;***&#10;ALLRIGHT allright calm down, it's just the stars!">
