    <task id="LOCAL-00150" summary="Rusty Skylines Alpha v1.6.3a Feb 20th 23:48&#10;&#10;Out with the old and in with the new!&#10;&#10;[Major]&#10;Removed all that legacy crap like the fake ECS and Systems scheduler, real good breath of fresh air!&#10;&#10;Added a car interpolator and a car 2 second tick simulator, all cars deferred in parallel.&#10;&#10;&#10;[Minor]&#10;Added &quot;V&quot; as the keybind for the new noclip: bool option in settings.toml! Real source engine stuff, pulled straight out of it&#10;&#10;&#10;***&#10;1.0.1 = clipper2-rust = &quot;1.0.1&quot;  Lol why">
