    <task id="LOCAL-00152" summary="Rusty Skylines Alpha v1.6.5a Feb 23rd 16:06&#10;&#10;[Major]&#10;Added early procedural Car Sounds with stereo&#10;Fixed UI elements moving not working&#10;Fixed UI resizing being not smooth&#10;&quot;Added&quot; advanced primitives (only loading and saving the void)&#10;&#10;[Minor]&#10;Added a COOL UI editing mode background, a checkerboard pattern based on the background color and warping to the mouse! This makes seeing bad contrast stuff way easier, and that's why I did it.&#10;Cleaned up UI code here and there&#10;&#10;***&#10;Saudi Egyptian Wells, important. WELL? What are you looking at, huh? Wells? Stop it. Stop looking at wells, they are not Jacky Welles! (Hahaha funny)&#10;&#10;I basically added car sounds yesterday.&#10;Then today sat down to program advanced primitives and added a layer to make one, then realized my entire UI system is kinda in shambles.&#10;I mean I couldn't move elements, what the hell!&#10;SO I went around the code and fixed all the crap that was bugging me, FINALLY!&#10;The UI part was CLEARLY neglected!">
