    <task id="LOCAL-00153" summary="Rusty Skylines Alpha v1.6.5b Feb 23rd 23:37&#10;&#10;[Major]&#10;Made audio device system SUPER robust, trying everything to find an audio device that works, rebuilding when some bs happens!&#10;&#10;&#10;[Minor]&#10;You can now drive a car again, the AI lets you, you are its slave!! Muhahaha&#10;&#10;You can now snap UI to a grid by holding Shift (configurable in the keybinds.toml file!)&#10;Changed the keybind system to support just &quot;Shift&quot; or &quot;Ctrl&quot; or &quot;Alt&quot; by themselves.&#10;Also changed the keybind system to distinguish between left and right shift and ctrl! (or AnyShift/AnyCtrl/AnyAlt!)&#10;&#10;***&#10;Wellcraft  Poor Alt Gr, my favourite key!  I hope the audio stuff works on all systems. It does on my arch Linux system with pipewire!">
