    <task id="LOCAL-00154" summary="Rusty Skylines Alpha v1.6.6a Feb 28th 22:07&#10;&#10;[Major]&#10;Added advanced primitives. Idk if they work yet, but kinda implemented.&#10;Changed settings to be usable for the advanced primitives so they can set the settings using UI! (SOON!!1)&#10;Fixed Resizing not working at all (an if statement returned because both old and new sizes were the same, but called after the new size has replaced the old size!!)&#10;&#10;[Minor]&#10;Resizing the window now resizes and moves the UI elements!&#10;&#10;***&#10;Sorry for not being active at all the last few days. I am a bit sick of some flu and got hooked on modded Minecraft and watching shows. Maybe I needed that break, I'm not sure, but I sure as hell didn't make any progress, only yesterday and today a bit! I tried to program but immediately found implementing the Advanced Primitives was way too complex for my current state (flu and sleep-deprived and dopamine-fried) &#10;I mean, today was awesome! We went out grilling with the whole family, very good! Berner sind geil!">
