    <task id="LOCAL-00155" summary="Rusty Skylines Alpha v1.6.7a Feb 2nd 22:47&#10;&#10;[Major]&#10;Added new UI primitive: Rect! &#10;The Rect is a simple Rectangle, with future texture support on it!&#10;It will be able to tint the texture!&#10;&#10;Actually made UI actions be pushed and parsed with my new parser, some functions now ACTUALLY work!!&#10;&#10;[Minor]&#10;Fixed some other crap I forgot about, but you know how much &quot;crap&quot; I fixed? Thousands of craps! These craps are carrying my game!&#10;&#10;New actions: ToggleSettingBool and SetSettingBool(state)&#10;Fixed the SettingOp thing that defines the operation to be used to change avs and settings.&#10;&#10;Renamed UiButtonLoader to just Ui, because that's what it is!!&#10;Cleaned out some code.&#10;&#10;***&#10;Hello darkness my little friend, I hope to see you again. Hello talkness my lil' friend">
