    <task id="LOCAL-00162" summary="Rusty Skylines Alpha v1.6.14a March 16th 23:04 NOT PI DAY, again...!!&#10;&#10;wgpu_render_manager updated to 0.2.6&#10;&#10;[Major]&#10;Added texture support for the props, using my procedural texture manager of course!&#10;&#10;Added leaves texture, it is shit. I must improve it all.&#10;&#10;[Minor]&#10;Changed some stuff to 64 bit regarding distance calculations or something.&#10;&#10;Fixed LOD distance calculation for the props.&#10;&#10;Debug rendering the procedural textures is now possible.&#10;&#10;***&#10;Cool">
