    <task id="LOCAL-00163" summary="Rusty Skylines Alpha v1.6.15a March 20th 23:05 NOT PI DAY, again...:(!?!&#10;&#10;wgpu_render_manager updated to 0.2.7&#10;wgpu updated to 29.0.0&#10;&#10;[Major]&#10;Made the procedural tree model way better, now using L-System branching with criss-crossing stretched non-quadratic leave cards. nerd.&#10;&#10;Props (trees) have CSM shadows now and also support alpha cutoff from their textures automatically.&#10;Normals diffuse lighting is now actually based off the sun's direction. Ambient is now lower.&#10;&#10;Complete rework of the saving system, made it from scratch.&#10;It saves Roads and Props now too!&#10;You can call commands like &quot;save_game&quot; or &quot;load_save(save_name)&quot; in UI actions!&#10;The save file is completely different. It consists of a text-editor-readable header and a compressed data block for the terrain edits, roads and props.&#10;Player position and ya and pitch are saved in the SaveState as well!&#10;&#10;Moved user data to OS-based folders, like Appdata on Windows or .local on Linux!&#10;&#10;Added Screenshot support!! Lossless of course.&#10;&#10;&#10;[Minor]&#10;Improved the leaves texture a bit.&#10;&#10;Rewinding time is possible again.&#10;&#10;Adaptive CSM shadow PCF blurring size per cascade.&#10;&#10;***&#10;Cool worlds">
