    <task id="LOCAL-00166" summary="Rusty Skylines Alpha v1.6.18a April 2nd 15:51&#10;&#10;Not april april...&#10;&#10;[Major]&#10;Fixed text just vanishing because of other text and more weirdness.&#10;The issue was in ui.rs in render() where I called brush.queue() on every layer which overwrote the last layer somehow so that's why it only happened after I added more text, and after I switched to the wgpu-text rendering crate.&#10;The text should actually render faster now!&#10;&#10;Added three new actions: delete_element, add_element, clone_element&#10;Self-explanatory.&#10;&#10;Every field in any action that isn't so special now has access to FULL EXPRESSION SUPPORT!&#10;Arrays now have access to full expression support to!&#10;And also self. support.&#10;&#10;For example:     - !Text&#10;                   id: add_circle_test&#10;                   actions:&#10;                     - on:r add(self.menu, self.layer, heytherewhatsup, circle, [self.center.x, self.center.y+self.center.y*0.2]) ....&#10;&#10;[Minor]&#10;You can now delete elements using X again! Idk why or when it stopped working...&#10;&#10;Fixed resizing all selected elements at once not working, because the keybind got consumed.&#10;&#10;&#10;***&#10;APRIL APRIL!!!! 1st">
