    <task id="LOCAL-00169" summary="Rusty Skylines Alpha v1.7.0a April 10th 21:31&#10;&#10;[Major]&#10;Added Zoning Tool, pretty good already.&#10;The Zoning tool can make closed loops and prevent placing if any other zone or itself is in its way, and also snaps to road lanes too for now.&#10;It has no use at all, just visual for now.&#10;&#10;Added thick lines support to gizmo, as well as 'filled' gizmo!&#10;&#10;UI Rects can now glow too!&#10;&#10;[Minor]&#10;Kinda Major: Fixed Circles and Rects only having one be able to glow, because of wgsl struct mismatch shifting the whole information over some bytes each element!&#10;&#10;Added 'For' action to UI actions, which is a for loop, who would have thought?&#10;It exposes variables 'idx' and 'var' which are set every iteration with the new values from the iterator item!&#10;&#10;Fixed render_dt and render_fps because they were controlled by time speed for some reason... BUT that wasn't in any version, just in the last transfer commit!&#10;&#10;Made render_dt and render_fps smoothed to prevent jittering of FPS count and dt.&#10;&#10;***&#10;I think that's basically all? In 4 days, not too much but fine!&#10;I mean I worked one whole day: Gerüst aufstellen um Solarmodule auf einen Dach zu legen, Wir haben nur das Gerüst aufgestellt, weil es viel gerüst zum aufstellen gab! Layher.&#10;Und gestern ganzen tag in den Arcaden, Biotech USA">
