      <updated>1775850327690</updated>
    </task>
    <task id="LOCAL-00170" summary="Rusty Skylines Alpha v1.7.1a April 13th 21:29&#10;&#10;[Major]&#10;Fixed lots of issues with zoning and made Zoning Types!&#10;Residential, Commercial, Industrial and Office! (God I hate typing them out, it's the 5th time already!)&#10;Each of these has a different color.&#10;I am coloring the zone in its respective color and showing a preview of the new zone when hovering over a zone that's already been made to replace its zone type!&#10;&#10;You can set the Zone Type of your cursor using the handy GUI elements I added with their respective color!&#10;&#10;Added Zooming, just like with mods in Minecraft, holding 'C' to zoom in and releasing to zoom out, zoom speed settable using the variables: zoom_speed and unzoom_speed!&#10;&#10;Changed the save and settings and colors folder to the Documents folder instead of Appdata/local or user/.local/share!&#10;This makes finding the folder way easier, and trust me, I played Minecraft long enough to know what a pain it is to find the Roaming folder every time!!&#10;&#10;COLORS:&#10;Added color.toml file to set colors from outside the game! Also, all colors in the file can be set using the set command in UI using variables!&#10;I will try to include as many color bindings as possible, but don't put focus on it.&#10;&#10;[Minor]&#10;Quickly added Demands and Economy structs just because I wanted to, with no use for now at all.&#10;&#10;Gizmo supports transparency now.&#10;&#10;***&#10;YOOO LOL ROFL LMAO LMFAO Who is LMFAO is he his brother? AH now we know LMFAO is LMAO's brother! And what does 'HEHEHEHA!!!' mean? Is it some kind of demonic laughter by the hacker LMAO? TELL ME!!">
