    </task>
    <task id="LOCAL-00183" summary="Rusty Skylines Alpha v1.7.14a May 31st 22:43&#10;&#10;[Major]&#10;*Signfinding Section Start*&#10;Changed the Partition System COMPLETELY from hierarchical partitions referencing Nodes.&#10;Instead, each partition now stores up to 20 BuildingIds so they are bundled together for a WAY easier signfinding implementation.&#10;&#10;Added functions to the Arm of a Node that extract the travel time (EMA ExponentialMovingAverage) properly, with BuildingId first, PartitionId second and DistrictId last.&#10;&#10;Added a function that ranks the best arms for an intersection (node ofc).&#10;*Signfinding Section End*&#10;&#10;&#10;[Minor]&#10;Placing lots now searches for roads in a 3x3 chunk radius instead of only the mouse chunk.&#10;&#10;Placing lots also now shows only road points in a radius instead of all road points of a road. Performance is heavily improved by doing so!&#10;&#10;Now adding and removing car spawning road nodes when nodes get enabled or disabled.&#10;&#10;Settings menu UI now has all gizmo options available.&#10;&#10;Partition Gizmo is now completely different, adapted to the new Partitions system.&#10;&#10;Drag-Removing Buildings and Lots is now possible (buggy, buildings or lots reappear for some reason?!)&#10;&#10;***&#10;Gib mir doggy gib mir doggy gib mir doggy... SPAẞ ich bin ein Mann und ich bin nicht schwul!!&#10;Sorry for this German throw-up.&#10;&#10;The Signfinding is progressing!&#10;I came from my vacation in Turkey, best vacation yet imo.&#10;At 19 yrs old, it feels different!&#10;Constantly went to the Sauna and Beach (Antalya)&#10;The hotel was the Kremlin Palast Hotel near Lara.&#10;&#10;Ok cool. I will go to sleep soon!&#10;So, May basically? May is over and my game has grown.&#10;Each month, my game becomes better!&#10;I looked at the releases on GitHub I've built (the executables) and my game really has improved dramatically!&#10;So much so that I get a feeling of dread when I look at my old releases, because I am just imagining myself back then not knowing wtf happens months later and just working through the problems I have worked through before!&#10;And I AM the before right now! Always am...">
